{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Constitution 15 or higher\n\nWith great fortitude of body and experience in battle, you have learned to emulate adamantine both offensively and defensively. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Weapons you wield are treated as adamantine. Your unarmed strikes are similarly treated as adamantine weapons.\n\n- When an attack roll made against you would score a critical hit, you may use your reaction to negate the critical hit, causing the attack to instead be treated as a normal hit. Once you use this ability you must finish a long rest before using it again.","level":1}],"id":"Customf286d712-6cec-4762-9973-596a38da5f05","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Adamantine Spirit [SM] [Revised]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}